<title>BELGIUM: Italy ERM re-entry would not affect Sweden-Asbrink.</title>
<headline>Italy ERM re-entry would not affect Sweden-Asbrink.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>An Italian entry into the European Union's exchange rate mechanism would not affect the Swedish attitude towards membership, Finance Minister Erik Asbrink said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;No,&quot; Asbrink told reporters in response to a question whether possible Italian membership would affect the Swedish position on the issue.</p>
<p>He has earlier often said ERM membership is not on the agenda for Sweden.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11</p>
